@SmartNotes_HostAddress = http://localhost:5262

### Register
POST {{SmartNotes_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Test User", "email": "test@smartnotes.pk", "password": "test1234" }

### Login
POST {{SmartNotes_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "Email": "usman@smartnotes.pk", "Password": "usman1234" }






### Create personal note
POST {{SmartNotes_HostAddress}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1

{ "Title": "Test note", "Content": "Hello", "NoteType": "personal", "Category": "Study" }

### Create group note
POST {{SmartNotes_HostAddress}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1

{ "Title": "Test group", "NoteType": "group" }

### List (Usman has demo notes 1, 2, 8 and 9)
GET {{SmartNotes_HostAddress}}/api/notes
X-User-Id: 1

### Get one
GET {{SmartNotes_HostAddress}}/api/notes/1
X-User-Id: 1

### Another user cannot see it (expect 404)
GET {{SmartNotes_HostAddress}}/api/notes/1
X-User-Id: 3

### Update
PUT {{SmartNotes_HostAddress}}/api/notes/1
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1

{ "Title": "Changed title", "Content": "Changed", "NoteType": "personal", "Category": "Study" }

### Delete (use the id of the note you created)
DELETE {{SmartNotes_HostAddress}}/api/notes/11
X-User-Id: 1





### Add a tag to note 1
POST {{SmartNotes_HostAddress}}/api/notes/1/tags
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1

{ "Name": "Exam" }

### Get all my tags
GET {{SmartNotes_HostAddress}}/api/notes/tags
X-User-Id: 1

### Lock note 1
POST {{SmartNotes_HostAddress}}/api/notes/1/lock
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1

{ "Password": "1234" }

### Verify lock password (for opening locked note)
POST {{SmartNotes_HostAddress}}/api/notes/1/verify-lock
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1

{ "Password": "1234" }

### Unlock (remove lock from note 1)
POST {{SmartNotes_HostAddress}}/api/notes/1/unlock
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1

{ "Password": "1234" }






### Add reminder to note 1
POST {{SmartNotes_HostAddress}}/api/notes/1/reminders
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1

{ "Title": "Submit DB assignment", "RemindAt": "2026-11-15T10:00:00Z" }

### Add location to note 1
POST {{SmartNotes_HostAddress}}/api/notes/1/locations
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1

{ "PlaceName": "BIIT", "SubLocation": "LT5" }

### Get note 1 (returns note + tags + reminders + locations!)
GET {{SmartNotes_HostAddress}}/api/notes/1
X-User-Id: 1

### Get Calendar
GET {{SmartNotes_HostAddress}}/api/notes/calendar
X-User-Id: 1






### 1. Get members of group note 8
GET {{SmartNotes_HostAddress}}/api/notes/8/members
X-User-Id: 1

### 2. Add user 3 as a member to group note 8
POST {{SmartNotes_HostAddress}}/api/notes/8/members
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1

{ "UserId": 3 }

### 3. Add a text contribution to group note 8 (as user 3)
POST {{SmartNotes_HostAddress}}/api/notes/8/contributions
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 3

{ "Type": "text", "Text": "I will prepare the slides" }

### 4. Add a location contribution to group note 8 (as user 1)
POST {{SmartNotes_HostAddress}}/api/notes/8/contributions
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1

{ "Type": "location", "Text": "BIIT", "SubLocation": "Lab 4" }

### 5. Get all contributions of group note 8
GET {{SmartNotes_HostAddress}}/api/notes/8/contributions
X-User-Id: 1





### 1. Get My Profile
GET {{SmartNotes_HostAddress}}/api/profile
X-User-Id: 1

### 2. Get My Friends List
GET {{SmartNotes_HostAddress}}/api/friends
X-User-Id: 1

### 3. Send a Chat Message + Share Note 1 with Friend (User 2)
POST {{SmartNotes_HostAddress}}/api/messages/2
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1

{ "Text": "Check out this note!", "SharedNoteId": 1 }

### 4. Get Chat Thread with User 2
GET {{SmartNotes_HostAddress}}/api/messages/2
X-User-Id: 1

### 5. Global Search
GET {{SmartNotes_HostAddress}}/api/search?q=Database
X-User-Id: 1







### 1. Add a Voice Note with Transcript & Voice Command to Personal Note 1
POST {{SmartNotes_HostAddress}}/api/notes/1/voice
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary
X-User-Id: 1

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="displayName"

Audio 1
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="durationSeconds"

12
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="transcript"

Meeting at location BIIT LT5 tomorrow
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="language"

en
--boundary--

### 2. Get Note 1 (Now includes voice_notes + updated location!)
GET {{SmartNotes_HostAddress}}/api/notes/1
X-User-Id: 1










### 1. Share Note 1 with Text + Location (Works -> 200 OK)
POST {{SmartNotes_HostAddress}}/api/messages/2
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1

{
  "Text": "Sharing my note with location!",
  "SharedNoteId": 1,
  "IncludeText": true,
  "IncludeLocation": true,
  "IncludeReminder": false,
  "IncludeVoice": false
}

### 2. Try sharing ONLY Location without Text or Voice (Blocked -> 400 Bad Request)
POST {{SmartNotes_HostAddress}}/api/messages/2
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1

{
  "SharedNoteId": 1,
  "IncludeText": false,
  "IncludeLocation": true,
  "IncludeReminder": false,
  "IncludeVoice": false
}








### Test Whisper STT with Model_Check_Voice_Sample.m4a
POST {{SmartNotes_HostAddress}}/api/notes/1/voice
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary
X-User-Id: 1

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample_urdu.16k.wav"
Content-Type: audio/wav

< ./sample_urdu.16k.wav
--boundary--












